{"id": "t067-057", "text": "natasha's hamster nibbles died on tuesday she was really upset about it more than she thought she'd be", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "natasha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "hamster nibbles", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "died", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tuesday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "upset", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t067-058", "text": "so uh just had a long chat with elena she's doing a bit better now she's started a pottery class on wednesday evenings and she's met some nice people there her mum is coming down the weekend after next to stay with her which she's looking forward to and she said she's thinking of getting a dog maybe sometime in the new year once she's settled in the new flat", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "elena", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "doing a bit better", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pottery class", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "wednesday evenings", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend after next", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "looking forward to", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a dog", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "sometime in the new year", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "once she's settled in the new flat", "anchor": "e3"}]}
{"id": "t067-059", "text": "beatriz's husband eduardo is turning fifty early next month and she's planning a surprise dinner on the saturday night at the portuguese place he loves he's into vintage watches and old football shirts so i should think about chipping in with the others for something like that remind me to message beatriz tomorrow morning to ask what the budget is", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "beatriz", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "husband", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "eduardo", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "turning fifty", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "early next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "surprise dinner", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "party", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the saturday night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "portuguese place", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vintage watches", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "i3", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old football shirts", "owner": "p2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "think about chipping in with the others for something like that", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message beatriz", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "message", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "beatriz", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow morning", "anchor": "a2"}]}
